              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.4.8+2KI.4.9+2KI.4.10+2KI.4.11+2KI.4.12+2KI.4.13+2KI.4.14+2KI.4.15+2KI.4.16+2KI.4.17+2KI.4.18+2KI.4.19+2KI.4.20+2KI.4.21+2KI.4.22+2KI.4.23+2KI.4.24+2KI.4.25+2KI.4.26+2KI.4.27+2KI.4.28+2KI.4.29+2KI.4.30+2KI.4.31+2KI.4.32+2KI.4.33+2KI.4.34+2KI.4.35+2KI.4.36+2KI.4.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Luker 4.8-37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare meno Elica owaco ki dako ma yam ocero latinne ni, “A woko wek icit ki jo ma i odi icibed ka mo ma itwero ducu; pien Rwot ociko pi kec, ci bipoto i lobo pi mwaka abiro.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dako-nu ocako a woko ci otiyo kit macalo dano pa Lubaŋa owaco-ni; ocito ki jo ma i ode ci obedo i lobo pa jo Piliciti mwaka abiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka mwaka abiro otum, dako-nu ocako dwogo nia ki i lobo pa Jo Piliciti, okato ocito bot kabaka ka koko pi ode ki pi lobone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare-nu onoŋo kabaka tye ka lok ki Gikaji ma latic pa dano pa Lubaŋa, kun wacce ni, “Titta gin madito ducu ma doŋ Elica otyeko tiyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka onoŋo obetito bot kabaka kit ma Elica ocero ki dano muto-ni, nen, dako ma en ocero wode-ni okok bot kabaka pi ode ki pilobone. Ci Gikaji owacci, “Rwoda, kabaka, man en aye dako, ki wode bene ene, ma Elica ocero-ni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kabaka openyo dako-nu, ci en otitte, omiyo kabaka okwanyo dano mo madit pire, kun wacci, “Dwok jami ma yam pa dako-nu ducu bote, kacel ki jami ma ocek i pottine nia wa i kare ma en obwoto ki lobone nio kwede wa onyoo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare meno El ica ocito i Damaciko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ben-adad kabaka me Ciria onoŋo two; ka onoŋo gititte pire ni, “Dano pa Lubaŋa obino kany,” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kabaka owaco bot Kajael ni, “Kwany mot icit kwede ka jolo wi dano pa Lubaŋa, ci ipeny dog Rwot ki bote, kun ipenye ka abicar, ki i two man.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kit meno Kajael ocako cito ka jolo wiye, otero ki mot bene, kit kwa jami ducu mabeco ma tye i Damaciko, ma kinaga pyeraŋwen guyeyo. Ka ocito ocuŋ i nyime, owacci, “Wodi Ben-adad ma kabaka me Ciria ocwala boti, kun wacci, ‘Abicaŋ i two man?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elica owacce ni, “Cit iciwacce ni, ‘In ibican adada’; ento Rwot otyeko nyuto bota ni en bito woko adada.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En ociko waŋe i kom Kajael kun gaye kwede, nio ka lewic omako, ci dano pa Lubaŋa ocako koko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kajael openyo ni, “Rwoda, dok ikok piŋo kaa?” En ogamo ni, “Pien aŋeyo tim marac ma ibitime ki jo Icrael; ibiwaŋo gaŋi gogogi woko ki mac, ibineko co matino woko ki pala lucwan, kun inyoto litino lukere woko, dok mongi ma giyac gibiryeko igi woko.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.19.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Luker 19.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kajael ogamo ni, “Laticci odoko gin aŋo, ma en gwok ma mwa-ni, ci twero tiyo gin madit ma rom meno kulu?” Elica odok iye ni, “Rwot otyeko nyutta ni, in aye ibibedo kabaka me Ciria.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En ocako a woko ki bot Elica, ci ocito wa bot rwode. Rwode openye ni, “El ica owaco boti lok aŋo?” En owacci, “En otitta ni in ibicaŋ adada.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwone en okwanyo taulo, oluto i pii ci oyaro i waŋe, nio ka oto kwede. Kajael oleyo ka tyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I mwaka me abic me ker pa Joram wod pa Akab kabaka me Icrael, en aye Jekoram wod pa Yekocapat kabaka me Juda ocako iye loc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ocamo ker ma onoŋo mwaka me ditte pyeradek wiye aryo, ci obedo ka loc i Jerucalem pi mwaka aboro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obedo ka lubo kit pa luker me Icrael, kun tiyo kit macalo jo me ot pa Akab gutiyo, pien dakone nya pa Akab. Obedo ka tiyo gin ma nen marac i waŋ Rwot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.11.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Luker 11.36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Rwot pe omito tyeko Juda woko ducu, pi laticce Daudi, kit ma con ocikke bote ni ebimiye bedo ki mac tara, en ki likwaye matwal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.27.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acak 27.40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I karene en aye jo Edom gujemo iye woko i kom loc pa Juda, ci guketo kabakagi pigi kengi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joram okato loka Jair kacel: ki gadigadi lwennye ducu, ci oa woko i dyewor, ci en ki ludito ma giloyo gadigadi lwennye gulwenyo i kom jo Edom ma gurume dyere-ni; ento monnye oriŋo odwogo woko paco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omiyo Edom ojemo woko i kom loc pa Juda nio wa onyoo. Ka dok Libna bene ocako jemo woko i kare-nu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lok kom Joram mudoŋŋe ducu, ki gin ma yam otiyo ducu, gityeko coyone i buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joram oto, oywe kacel ki kwarine, dok giyike kacel ki kwarine i gaŋ pa Daudi; Akajia ma wode aye oleyo ka tyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
