              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I mwaka me apar wiye aryo me loc pa Joram wod pa Akab, kabaka me Icrael, Akajia wod pa Jekoram, kabaka me Juda, ocako camo iye ker. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akajia onoŋo ditte romo mwaka pyeraryo wiye aryo ka ocamo ker, ci obedo ka loc i Jerucalem pi mwaka acel. Minne nyiŋe Atalia; en yam lakwar Omri kabaka me Icrael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akajia bene obedo ka lubo kit pa jo me ot pa Akab, obedo ka tiyo gin ma nen marac i waŋ Rwot, kit macalo jo me ot pa Akab obedo ka tiyone, pien onoŋo jo paoce ot pa Akab.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
